      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26206/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat 1 cup white sugar, butter, oil, and confectioners' sugar together in a large bowl with an electric mixer until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lix9yaUm5JOWJ1QJsIne4DoFU6I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/26206-pecan-sandies---step-02-ad74e3a5d4bf4450896ad4ce4b69149f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26206/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add eggs, one at a time, beating well after each addition. Beat in vanilla extract.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4iPwBy5OVlmQOcDESjkq0Jtzido=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/26206-pecan-sandies--step-03-f3be3f91adde42deab2d446286a10337.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26206/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, baking soda, cream of tartar, and salt in a medium bowl; stir into egg mixture until dough comes together. Mix in pecans.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IaU_6O3JN6nCpOSc5blm-JCSc9Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/26206-pecan-sandies--step-05-75568478f41f4882bd5292604b424ec2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26206/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place remaining 1/2 cup white sugar into a small shallow bowl. Shape dough into 1 inch balls and flatten slightly; roll in sugar to coat evenly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/44L_nV6L2PwGryaijvpvwErvwFQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/26206-pecan-sandies--step-06-02-16a2f3f8d51d49b48793aaac11d5bc7d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26206/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place cookies 2 inches apart onto ungreased cookie sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QJe-Xfc24fJ5ppkVE2avHEhwJ-w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/26206-pecan-sandies--step-07-02-c49542b0b4ea45d18a2383b54e1ed9dd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26206/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until the edges are golden, 10 to 12 minutes. Remove cookies to wire racks to cool completely.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
